    "text": "familydestinationsguide.com\nwebsite\nBeaverton\nThe Burgers At This Diner In Oregon Are So Good, You’ll Drive Miles Just For A Bite\nBy Noah Harris,\n1 days agoThere’s something almost poetic about a classic American diner with chrome siding gleaming under Oregon’s often-cloudy skies. The Blue Moon Diner in Beaverton stands as a shining beacon of comfort food excellence in a world of trendy, here-today-gone-tomorrow eateries. You know those places worth setting your GPS for,...\n3",
